  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "Avishkar is the renamed plane of Kaladesh, the home plane of the Nalaars and the Varmas, where the Aetherdrift race ends.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/aetherdrift-episode-2-pit-stop",
     "p:stories/aetherdrift-episode-5-first-over-the-line"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-2-pit-stop",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-5-first-over-the-line"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Its profile says the Consulate was overthrown in a popular, nearly bloodless revolution and Kaladesh was reborn as Avishkar, which is then united under the new Avishkar Assembly, planning to resurrect the Ghirapur Grand Prix.",
    "cites": [
     "avishkar-plane-e0",
     "avishkar-plane-e1"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/avishkar-plane#:~:text=The%20ruling%20Consulate%20has,popular%2C%20nearly%20bloodless%20revolution.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/avishkar-plane#:~:text=The%20plane%20is%20now,called%20the%20Avishkar%20Assembly"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The Consulate then announces a month-long fair that is secretly a deception to gather and control the plane's newest technologies, but the rebel Renegades thwart the plan, clearing the way for Avishkar's new beginnings.",
    "cites": [
     "avishkar-plane-e2",
     "avishkar-plane-e3"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/avishkar-plane#:~:text=In%20truth%2C%20the%20Fair%20was%20a%20deception",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/avishkar-plane#:~:text=Their%20plan%20was%20thwarted,known%20as%20the%20Renegades"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "During Aetherdrift, Chandra and Nissa stay there with Pia, who teases Chandra as her turncoat daughter, and later Elspeth heals Chandra and blesses her and Nissa before vanishing.",
    "cites": [
     "aetherdrift-episode-2-pit-stop-e0",
     "aetherdrift-episode-2-pit-stop-e3",
     "aetherdrift-episode-6-the-bloodless-revolution-e36",
     "aetherdrift-episode-6-the-bloodless-revolution-e38"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-2-pit-stop#:~:text=Nissa.%20Her%20Nissa.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-2-pit-stop#:~:text=Don%27t%20deprive%20me%20of,with%20my%20turncoat%20daughter.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-6-the-bloodless-revolution#:~:text=Concentrated%20light%20illuminates%20Chandra%27s,her%20back%2C%20her%20ribs",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-6-the-bloodless-revolution#:~:text=And%20many%20blessings%20on%20your%20relationship."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Sita reveals that her father Mohar is in jail for attempting a coup.",
    "cites": [
     "aetherdrift-episode-6-the-bloodless-revolution-e39"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/aetherdrift-episode-6-the-bloodless-revolution#:~:text=Considering%20he%27s%20in%20jail%2C,things%20to%20worry%20about"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Later stories mention it as Chandra's home plane, and as a plane ruled by the Consulate in the Echoverse and led by Pia in the normal version.",
    "cites": [
